WEBVTT

01:33.251 --> 01:35.851
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:36.120 --> 01:38.021
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.090 --> 01:41.060
(Episode 15)

01:46.861 --> 01:47.560
Song Yan.

01:47.631 --> 01:48.530
Have another date cake.

01:57.540 --> 01:58.211
What are you looking at?

01:59.180 --> 02:00.180
Did things end...

02:00.480 --> 02:01.480
after the last time?

02:02.010 --> 02:02.680
What do you mean "last time"?

02:03.351 --> 02:04.150
I knew it.

02:04.611 --> 02:05.751
That girl went crazy after drinking,

02:05.820 --> 02:06.751
but it doesn't count, right?

02:08.081 --> 02:09.021
Miao Miao, have a bun.

02:09.090 --> 02:09.820
Yes, have a bun.

02:10.191 --> 02:11.120
I told you,

02:11.191 --> 02:11.891
but you wouldn't listen.

02:11.961 --> 02:12.691
You insisted on going to her.

02:12.760 --> 02:14.221
See, you got dumped again.

02:15.090 --> 02:16.090
Look at you.

02:16.231 --> 02:16.961
That was a long time ago.

02:17.030 --> 02:18.130
Why bring it up?

02:18.461 --> 02:19.261
Because I want to.

02:19.361 --> 02:20.301
That woman is crazy.

02:20.361 --> 02:21.160
Why can't I say it?

02:21.900 --> 02:22.600
Song Yan.

02:22.671 --> 02:23.400
I'm begging you.

02:23.470 --> 02:25.000
Can you not go to her again?

02:25.340 --> 02:26.571
What's so good about her?

02:27.171 --> 02:28.000
She's the most arrogant...

02:28.071 --> 02:29.711
and cold-hearted person I've ever met.

02:29.970 --> 02:31.111
She has a heart of stone.

02:31.370 --> 02:32.141
Shut up.

02:32.711 --> 02:33.410
Miao Miao.

02:33.940 --> 02:34.711
That's enough.

02:36.810 --> 02:38.481
You don't have to be so critical of her.

02:39.850 --> 02:41.250
She's not who you think she is.

02:41.321 --> 02:42.521
How is she not?

02:47.521 --> 02:49.731
She's the most fragile and timid person I've ever met.

02:50.861 --> 02:51.831
Her?

02:52.430 --> 02:53.130
She wants to act crazy,

02:53.201 --> 02:53.900
make a fuss,

02:53.961 --> 02:54.900
be free.

02:55.930 --> 02:56.930
She doesn't want to listen.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.741
She pretends to be strong.

02:58.801 --> 02:59.701
But in reality,

02:59.900 --> 03:01.511
she's so fragile inside.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.041
That kind of personality...

03:06.310 --> 03:07.310
is the most useless.

03:08.981 --> 03:10.481
I think it's most effective to you.

03:10.780 --> 03:12.081
She has you wrapped around her finger.

03:15.991 --> 03:16.891
I don't know...

03:17.120 --> 03:18.261
if it's effective or not.

03:18.660 --> 03:19.660
Anyway,

03:19.720 --> 03:20.921
I just don't think...

03:21.060 --> 03:22.560
she's right for you.

03:23.030 --> 03:23.761
Yes.

03:23.831 --> 03:25.600
I think Li Meng from your unit...

03:25.660 --> 03:27.130
is a good girl.

03:27.731 --> 03:28.731
I think Mengmeng is good too.

03:29.900 --> 03:31.301
Uncle, Aunt.

03:31.370 --> 03:32.141
I'll get going.

03:34.470 --> 03:35.541
- Song Yan. - Take care.

03:36.410 --> 03:38.041
You can't even shut your mouth when you're eating.

03:38.111 --> 03:38.810
Sit down.

03:40.211 --> 03:41.180
Seriously...

03:41.241 --> 03:42.081
Watch your mouth.

03:42.180 --> 03:42.981
Why do you keep poking...

03:43.051 --> 03:43.910
on your cousin's wound?

03:43.981 --> 03:45.880
That's right. You have no filter.

03:47.220 --> 03:48.180
Have a fried dough stick.

03:48.620 --> 03:49.451
I bought it just for you.

03:49.590 --> 03:50.620
Eat.

03:57.761 --> 03:58.530
Song Yan!

03:59.461 --> 04:00.130
Song Yan.

04:01.130 --> 04:01.801
Aunt.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.100
Here.

04:03.331 --> 04:04.530
You didn't drink the soy milk.

04:04.600 --> 04:05.271
Take it.

04:05.771 --> 04:07.041
It's okay for me not to drink it.

04:07.100 --> 04:08.171
You don't have to come all the way here.

04:09.211 --> 04:11.840
Don't take what Zhai Miao said just now to heart.

04:13.111 --> 04:13.810
It's fine.

04:15.680 --> 04:16.981
But I think it's good...

04:17.551 --> 04:18.551
to figure out...

04:18.620 --> 04:19.481
some things sooner too.

04:19.850 --> 04:20.850
Take it easy.

04:21.081 --> 04:23.220
After all, our families have a lot of grudges.

04:24.290 --> 04:25.321
But our family matters...

04:25.660 --> 04:26.660
have nothing to do with her.

04:26.720 --> 04:28.490
But it has something to do with you.

04:28.660 --> 04:30.290
Think about how much you suffered back then.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.090
We can't just pretend...

04:31.160 --> 04:32.860
that nothing happened.

04:34.100 --> 04:34.860
Don't worry.

04:35.071 --> 04:36.001
I can deal with it.

04:39.571 --> 04:40.800
Are you determined...

04:40.970 --> 04:42.040
to get back with her?

04:46.011 --> 04:47.011
There are many things...

04:47.610 --> 04:49.081
that can't be done just because you want to.

04:49.681 --> 04:50.650
It's not that easy.

04:51.251 --> 04:52.681
It's the same for her and me.

04:54.420 --> 04:55.420
We'll just go with the flow.

04:56.490 --> 04:57.150
All right.

04:57.550 --> 04:58.420
Go home.

04:59.821 --> 05:01.090
Don't force yourself.

05:01.261 --> 05:02.730
Remember to drink the soy milk.

05:02.790 --> 05:03.461
I will.

05:03.561 --> 05:04.461
It can't be set aside for too long.

05:35.290 --> 05:36.090
Chief Song.

05:36.360 --> 05:37.131
Are you going to the station?

05:37.761 --> 05:38.701
Get in.

05:47.571 --> 05:48.910
I remember you don't live here.

05:49.110 --> 05:49.771
Were you passing by?

05:50.141 --> 05:51.240
I heard there's a cake shop nearby...

05:51.311 --> 05:52.740
that's really good,

05:52.811 --> 05:54.240
so I came to buy some.

05:55.081 --> 05:56.751
You should bring some to the station later.

05:57.150 --> 05:57.811
It's okay.

05:58.420 --> 05:59.621
I don't like sweets.

06:01.821 --> 06:03.050
It's not just for you.

06:03.521 --> 06:04.391
It's for the other staff too.

06:06.061 --> 06:06.821
Okay.

07:02.381 --> 07:03.881
Do you still like her?

07:07.881 --> 07:08.891
It's not obvious...

07:09.451 --> 07:10.251
that you're...

07:10.821 --> 07:12.021
the masochistic type.

07:13.621 --> 07:15.431
Look, she doesn't even like you.

07:15.631 --> 07:16.530
Why are you doing this?

07:20.160 --> 07:21.400
She belittled and dismissed...

07:21.900 --> 07:23.100
such a good person like you,

07:23.170 --> 07:24.730
what right does she have?

07:25.170 --> 07:26.900
You should let her know...

07:27.201 --> 07:28.040
that many good girls...

07:28.100 --> 07:29.110
like you too.

07:29.170 --> 07:30.011
Li Meng.

07:30.371 --> 07:31.740
If you keep talking like this,

07:32.181 --> 07:33.410
you'll cross the line.

07:37.980 --> 07:39.420
I'm so mad at you.

07:40.050 --> 07:41.081
Look at you.

07:41.381 --> 07:42.321
You have character...

07:42.391 --> 07:44.121
and good looks.

07:44.821 --> 07:46.391
Why are you so hung up on one person?

07:46.860 --> 07:48.261
This is as far as you'll go.

07:54.131 --> 07:55.201
Thank you...

07:55.800 --> 07:56.931
for your concern.

07:58.071 --> 07:58.871
However,

07:59.941 --> 08:01.600
whether my relationship with my ex-girlfriend...

08:02.340 --> 08:03.441
is good or bad...

08:04.410 --> 08:06.311
isn't something others can interfere on.

08:07.441 --> 08:08.340
Do you understand?

08:11.050 --> 08:12.021
I'm sorry, okay?

08:12.881 --> 08:13.681
I know.

08:13.780 --> 08:15.121
It was wrong of me to say that.

08:15.321 --> 08:16.021
It's bad.

08:17.891 --> 08:18.660
But I couldn't help it.

08:20.220 --> 08:21.490
Have I ever told you...

08:22.290 --> 08:23.530
that it's impossible between us?

08:24.490 --> 08:25.660
So what if you did?

08:27.160 --> 08:28.571
Can't I do this because I want to?

08:30.131 --> 08:31.271
Look, why am I doing this?

08:31.800 --> 08:32.970
And why are you doing this?

08:34.170 --> 08:35.641
You're good in lecturing others about the same thing you're doing.

08:38.711 --> 08:40.941
You like someone else, not me.

08:41.181 --> 08:42.380
I can't do anything about it.

08:43.250 --> 08:45.880
But you should at least find someone who's nicer to you.

08:46.081 --> 08:47.821
At least let me accept my defeat, right?

08:49.791 --> 08:51.490
I want to accept my defeat too.

08:52.291 --> 08:53.620
Who should I reason with?

09:09.441 --> 09:10.370
Ms. Jia Jia.

09:10.541 --> 09:11.740
Why can't I...

09:11.811 --> 09:13.610
stay here forever?

09:13.980 --> 09:16.581
Because hospitals are for sick people.

09:16.781 --> 09:18.281
Then I have to stay sick.

09:19.151 --> 09:19.821
Nonsense.

09:20.081 --> 09:21.380
How can you stay sick?

09:21.781 --> 09:22.921
The ladies from the Women's Federation...

09:22.990 --> 09:24.191
will take you to the orphanage later.

09:24.520 --> 09:26.561
There are a lot of kids there.

09:26.620 --> 09:27.520
And there are teachers...

09:27.590 --> 09:29.291
who can teach you how to read and write.

09:30.130 --> 09:31.561
I don't have money.

09:31.630 --> 09:33.961
They'll kick me out.

09:35.770 --> 09:36.931
It's free.

09:37.470 --> 09:39.600
Ms. Qin Qin, is that so?

09:40.201 --> 09:41.340
Of course.

09:41.571 --> 09:43.541
Will you come to play with me then?

09:43.840 --> 09:44.640
I will.

09:45.240 --> 09:45.980
It's a promise.

09:47.311 --> 09:49.181
Cross your heart,

09:49.250 --> 09:51.681
- hope to die. - Hope to die.

10:12.301 --> 10:12.970
Doctor.

10:13.041 --> 10:14.301
My mom can't breathe again.

10:14.441 --> 10:15.311
Come, sit down.

10:16.370 --> 10:17.370
How long has this been going on?

10:17.441 --> 10:18.740
Forty minutes.

10:19.711 --> 10:20.911
I'll write you a prescription first...

10:20.980 --> 10:21.811
to inhale some oxygen.

10:21.980 --> 10:23.411
Inhaling oxygen doesn't work on my mom.

10:23.581 --> 10:24.811
Her condition only gets worse.

10:26.151 --> 10:27.220
Does she have any underlying health conditions?

10:27.281 --> 10:28.020
No.

10:28.081 --> 10:29.020
We've come to your hospital...

10:29.090 --> 10:30.051
for checkups several times.

10:30.250 --> 10:30.990
But they can't find...

10:31.051 --> 10:31.990
what's wrong with her.

10:32.921 --> 10:34.090
This happens every time she gets an attack?

10:34.860 --> 10:35.531
Yes.

10:35.590 --> 10:36.490
She always says...

10:36.831 --> 10:37.730
she's out of breath.

10:37.831 --> 10:38.701
It's hard to breathe.

10:38.961 --> 10:40.130
But when she comes to the hospital,

10:40.230 --> 10:41.730
they can't find out what's wrong.

10:43.270 --> 10:44.000
Don't be anxious.

10:51.211 --> 10:51.911
Turn around.

10:55.240 --> 10:55.951
Inhale.

10:57.051 --> 10:57.850
Exhale.

11:02.220 --> 11:03.750
Has she taken a CT scan of the lungs before?

11:03.821 --> 11:04.590
Yes.

11:08.120 --> 11:09.691
Based on this scan,

11:09.931 --> 11:11.130
there's nothing wrong.

11:11.890 --> 11:13.230
I also listened to her lungs just now.

11:13.301 --> 11:14.301
There's nothing wrong either.

11:16.901 --> 11:17.931
I think...

11:18.000 --> 11:18.941
your mom...

11:19.100 --> 11:20.671
might have hysteria.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.911
She's not sick,

11:23.240 --> 11:24.911
but she thinks she is.

11:25.311 --> 11:26.441
Giving herself psychological hints like this...

11:26.510 --> 11:27.581
for a long period of time...

11:27.640 --> 11:28.980
makes her body overreact.

11:29.181 --> 11:29.880
She's fine.

11:29.951 --> 11:30.781
Don't worry too much.

11:31.051 --> 11:32.681
Doctor, please prescribe some medicine.

11:33.281 --> 11:34.921
How can I prescribe medicine if she's not sick?

11:35.520 --> 11:37.051
Apart from breathing difficulties,

11:37.120 --> 11:37.791
is there anything else...

11:37.850 --> 11:38.821
that's bothering you?

11:39.691 --> 11:40.390
Director.

11:43.831 --> 11:45.291
Does this...

11:45.860 --> 11:46.801
happen often to you?

11:46.860 --> 11:47.531
Yes.

11:47.600 --> 11:48.770
It comes and goes.

11:49.130 --> 11:50.730
Get me a clean plastic bag.

11:50.801 --> 11:51.470
Okay.

11:53.770 --> 11:54.600
Don't be nervous.

11:54.671 --> 11:55.911
Let's try this.

11:57.441 --> 11:58.571
It might work.

11:59.811 --> 12:00.911
Don't be nervous.

12:00.980 --> 12:01.840
Here, hold this.

12:06.480 --> 12:08.651
I think your mom is suffering...

12:08.720 --> 12:10.220
from hyperventilation syndrome.

12:10.451 --> 12:11.990
Because of her hyperventilation,

12:12.461 --> 12:14.061
her carbon dioxide level is too low.

12:14.260 --> 12:15.661
Use this plastic bag then...

12:16.161 --> 12:18.061
to raise her carbon dioxide level.

12:18.490 --> 12:19.161
Let's observe a bit.

12:31.110 --> 12:31.811
Come on.

12:35.811 --> 12:36.781
How do you feel?

12:38.610 --> 12:39.651
I'm really fine now.

12:40.281 --> 12:41.850
I can finally breathe out.

12:42.651 --> 12:43.990
There's nothing seriously wrong with you.

12:44.051 --> 12:45.321
But I suggest...

12:45.921 --> 12:47.321
you see a psychiatrist.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.220
A psychiatrist?

12:49.331 --> 12:50.061
All right?

12:50.130 --> 12:51.130
I got it. Thank you.

12:52.031 --> 12:52.701
Be careful.

12:55.701 --> 12:56.401
Slowly.

12:56.901 --> 12:57.770
Xu Qin.

12:58.331 --> 13:00.770
For the condition of this patient,

13:01.941 --> 13:02.970
upon my observation,

13:03.840 --> 13:05.010
it seems that she is...

13:05.370 --> 13:06.240
going through menopause.

13:06.311 --> 13:10.010
Most likely, due to life or family situations,

13:10.081 --> 13:11.551
she's mentally...

13:11.951 --> 13:13.880
and emotionally stressed...

13:14.051 --> 13:14.880
and anxious.

13:15.791 --> 13:17.220
Do you know what your problem is?

13:18.250 --> 13:19.120
As a doctor,

13:19.191 --> 13:21.291
we don't just have to know how to treat patients.

13:22.431 --> 13:23.730
We also need to know how to read people.

13:55.461 --> 13:56.431
Instructor.

13:56.490 --> 13:57.230
What's the situation?

13:57.461 --> 13:58.730
Eight backpackers entered Mount Phoenix...

13:58.901 --> 13:59.701
and got trapped.

13:59.760 --> 14:00.831
How long have they been trapped?

14:00.901 --> 14:02.031
They entered yesterday at noon...

14:02.171 --> 14:03.600
and just sent out a signal this morning.

14:03.770 --> 14:05.171
Their GPS are broken...

14:05.541 --> 14:06.870
and they only have a contour map.

14:06.941 --> 14:08.441
They entered through the back hill.

14:08.500 --> 14:09.870
And they sneaked in...

14:09.941 --> 14:10.870
without the scenic spot's permission.

14:10.941 --> 14:11.941
The weather isn't good.

14:12.010 --> 14:12.941
It rained overnight in the mountains.

14:13.211 --> 14:14.380
The father of one of them...

14:14.441 --> 14:16.110
asked for help from the local civilian rescue team.

14:16.181 --> 14:18.010
But the rescue team also got trapped inside.

14:18.081 --> 14:19.380
Do you have the exact location?

14:19.620 --> 14:21.181
Just a rough description.

14:21.750 --> 14:22.590
Got it. Copy that.

14:48.681 --> 14:50.551
- When? - Right.

14:50.610 --> 14:51.480
When?

14:55.020 --> 14:55.821
You're finally here.

14:56.590 --> 14:57.421
We just got here too.

14:57.490 --> 14:58.821
Their families are very emotional right now.

14:58.890 --> 15:00.390
They want us to go up the mountain now.

15:01.061 --> 15:02.061
Let's understand the situation first.

15:02.360 --> 15:03.291
We need to at least know the exact location...

15:03.360 --> 15:04.061
of the trapped people.

15:04.130 --> 15:05.331
Look, I know that too.

15:05.490 --> 15:06.831
If we don't know the surrounding situation well,

15:06.901 --> 15:08.100
we can't just go in.

15:09.130 --> 15:10.000
Sir.

15:10.571 --> 15:12.130
Our children have been missing for a day.

15:12.201 --> 15:13.071
This is a matter of life and death.

15:13.140 --> 15:14.370
Why aren't you going in to save them yet?

15:14.941 --> 15:15.640
How about this?

15:16.110 --> 15:16.911
I'll pay.

15:17.010 --> 15:18.010
Is 100,000 yuan enough?

15:18.610 --> 15:19.911
If not, I'll add another 50,000 yuan.

15:20.140 --> 15:21.240
Why don't you name a price?

15:21.681 --> 15:23.010
If you go in and save them now,

15:23.181 --> 15:24.110
I'll pay any amount.

15:24.181 --> 15:25.651
It's not about money.

15:25.850 --> 15:26.620
It's not...

15:26.681 --> 15:28.281
It's not about money.

15:28.520 --> 15:30.250
If we don't know the surrounding situation well,

15:30.321 --> 15:31.451
we're also being irresponsible...

15:31.520 --> 15:32.291
to the trapped people.

15:32.720 --> 15:33.760
Sir.

15:33.821 --> 15:35.260
My son is a senior in college.

15:35.321 --> 15:36.990
They're all studying in prestigious universities.

15:37.061 --> 15:38.490
They're future talents.

15:38.561 --> 15:40.061
My sister is a freshman too.

15:41.901 --> 15:43.701
Your kids are precious.

15:43.870 --> 15:44.671
Firefighters...

15:44.730 --> 15:46.071
are other people's precious kids too.

15:46.140 --> 15:47.470
No one...

15:47.541 --> 15:49.211
can just randomly risk their lives.

15:49.340 --> 15:50.010
Everyone.

15:50.340 --> 15:51.071
Which person...

15:51.140 --> 15:52.380
knows the back hill's terrain?

15:52.441 --> 15:53.240
Me.

15:53.740 --> 15:54.740
I'm a local villager.

15:54.811 --> 15:56.151
I know the place.

15:56.581 --> 15:57.781
I'll get the drone and check.

15:57.850 --> 15:58.581
Actually,

15:58.651 --> 15:59.980
I've been listening to them for a while.

16:00.081 --> 16:00.750
I'm guessing...

16:00.821 --> 16:02.390
these kids aren't in the back hill.

16:02.451 --> 16:03.551
It's complicated there.

16:03.620 --> 16:04.850
They might have followed some stream...

16:04.921 --> 16:05.791
and went straight.

16:05.860 --> 16:07.020
They might be at the front hill.

16:07.291 --> 16:07.990
The front hill?

16:08.061 --> 16:08.760
Yes.

16:08.821 --> 16:09.490
There's a boulder there too?

16:09.561 --> 16:10.230
Yes.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.201
Where exactly is the front hill's location?

16:20.701 --> 16:21.770
It's right here. Look.

16:21.840 --> 16:22.541
This one.

16:22.610 --> 16:23.541
See if I marked the right one.

16:24.311 --> 16:25.041
- Over here. - Yes.

16:25.110 --> 16:25.941
There's a boulder here.

16:26.010 --> 16:27.581
It's called the Cock Crowing Rock.

16:27.640 --> 16:28.581
We used to collect...

16:28.640 --> 16:29.411
Chinese herbs there.

16:29.581 --> 16:30.711
But now, there are fewer Chinese herbs.

16:30.781 --> 16:31.781
We can't pick any.

16:31.850 --> 16:32.720
There are many snakes too.

16:32.781 --> 16:34.020
Very few people go there now.

16:34.651 --> 16:35.691
The terrain there is even more complicated.

16:36.291 --> 16:37.620
It'll be hard for them to get there.

16:43.331 --> 16:44.031
Got it.

16:47.500 --> 16:49.130
Calm down first.

16:49.500 --> 16:50.171
Chief.

16:50.230 --> 16:50.931
Come.

16:51.000 --> 16:51.970
I need to tell you something.

16:54.171 --> 16:54.941
Here's the thing.

16:55.500 --> 16:56.211
Look.

16:56.711 --> 16:57.571
Around here,

16:57.711 --> 16:59.041
there are two similar boulders.

16:59.110 --> 17:00.740
The backpackers might have described it wrongly.

17:00.941 --> 17:02.041
That's why the civilian rescue team...

17:02.110 --> 17:03.811
went to the Eagle Beak Rock in the back hill.

17:04.451 --> 17:05.581
Just now, the villager said...

17:05.951 --> 17:06.620
that there's a Cock Crowing Rock...

17:06.681 --> 17:07.651
in the front hill.

17:08.281 --> 17:09.191
This area...

17:09.250 --> 17:10.120
is even more remote...

17:10.191 --> 17:11.321
and rugged.

17:11.390 --> 17:12.361
It's more attractive for backpackers...

17:12.421 --> 17:13.320
to have adventures there.

17:14.961 --> 17:15.621
Look.

17:16.290 --> 17:17.691
I used thermal imaging around the area.

17:17.760 --> 17:19.330
I didn't find anything.

17:19.901 --> 17:20.961
I think the previous rescue team...

17:21.030 --> 17:21.800
didn't find them...

17:21.861 --> 17:23.000
because they chose...

17:23.371 --> 17:24.300
the wrong route from the start.

17:24.371 --> 17:25.701
Good thing we didn't rush in...

17:25.770 --> 17:27.171
when we first got here.

17:27.941 --> 17:29.411
Otherwise, we'd be stuck up there.

17:31.040 --> 17:31.911
Pack your gears.

17:31.970 --> 17:32.681
Get ready to go.

17:32.740 --> 17:33.411
- Yes. - Yes.

17:45.421 --> 17:46.621
If we find...

17:46.691 --> 17:47.591
the civilian rescue team first,

17:48.461 --> 17:49.431
we'll come to meet up with you.

17:51.030 --> 17:52.461
Be safe and keep in touch.

17:52.730 --> 17:53.401
Okay.

17:53.861 --> 17:54.730
Come on, let's go!

17:55.161 --> 17:55.901
Let's go!

18:18.191 --> 18:18.891
Have you eaten?

18:19.861 --> 18:20.560
Yes.

18:27.101 --> 18:28.260
I'm going to the dry cleaners.

18:30.671 --> 18:31.530
I'll go with you.

18:35.371 --> 18:36.740
Are you still mad at me?

18:37.711 --> 18:38.611
No.

18:40.141 --> 18:41.480
I should apologize too.

18:42.750 --> 18:43.580
What are you apologizing for?

18:43.881 --> 18:45.351
It's your birthday.

18:45.550 --> 18:46.750
But I still fought with you.

18:47.351 --> 18:48.020
I made your birthday...

18:48.080 --> 18:49.290
a miserable one.

18:51.091 --> 18:52.220
We didn't fight.

18:52.861 --> 18:54.060
It's called...

18:54.861 --> 18:55.520
a discussion.

18:57.661 --> 18:58.730
Then let's discuss again now.

18:59.931 --> 19:00.601
No.

19:01.260 --> 19:02.230
One discussion...

19:02.300 --> 19:03.570
resulted to a week of silent treatment.

19:04.000 --> 19:05.000
I'm going crazy.

19:07.070 --> 19:07.770
Come on.

19:08.300 --> 19:09.171
I'll go with you.

19:18.181 --> 19:18.980
This way.

19:19.181 --> 19:20.220
Watch your steps.

19:24.790 --> 19:26.520
- Is anyone there? - Hello?

19:26.591 --> 19:27.520
Say something if you hear us.

19:27.591 --> 19:28.790
We're firefighters.

19:28.861 --> 19:29.730
Is anyone there?

19:29.891 --> 19:30.760
- Hello? - Is anyone there?

19:30.830 --> 19:31.691
- Is anyone there? - Hello?

19:31.760 --> 19:32.730
- Hello? - Is anyone there?

19:32.901 --> 19:34.300
- Is anyone there? - Hello?

19:35.560 --> 19:36.570
- Song Yan. - We're firefighters!

19:36.631 --> 19:37.530
We still have some way to go.

19:38.070 --> 19:39.131
We've been walking for over three hours.

19:39.201 --> 19:40.500
- Let's take a break. - Hello?

19:40.970 --> 19:41.871
Is anyone there?

19:42.570 --> 19:44.211
Let's take a two-minute break.

19:45.770 --> 19:46.611
Give me the GPS.

19:57.050 --> 19:57.990
Do both paths...

19:58.320 --> 19:59.151
lead to the mountains?

19:59.220 --> 19:59.990
Yes, they do.

20:00.091 --> 20:00.820
Which one is faster?

20:01.060 --> 20:01.891
This one...

20:02.161 --> 20:02.961
is easier to traverse.

20:03.030 --> 20:03.730
But it's a bit of a detour.

20:03.790 --> 20:04.530
That one...

20:04.591 --> 20:05.290
is hard to traverse,

20:05.361 --> 20:06.230
but it's closer.

20:06.931 --> 20:07.760
Saving lives is more important.

20:07.830 --> 20:08.500
Let's walk faster.

20:08.560 --> 20:09.300
Okay.

20:09.371 --> 20:10.131
Let's go this way then.

20:10.201 --> 20:10.970
Let's go!

20:11.030 --> 20:11.770
Yes!

20:11.830 --> 20:12.941
- Let's go! - Come on!

20:14.500 --> 20:15.171
Let's go.

20:17.841 --> 20:18.841
Hello?

20:19.240 --> 20:21.381
- Is anyone there? - Hello?

20:21.441 --> 20:22.851
- We're firefighters! - Is anyone there?

20:22.911 --> 20:25.750
- Hello? - Is anyone there?

20:25.810 --> 20:26.780
Watch your steps, guys.

20:27.080 --> 20:29.181
- Is anyone there? - Hello?

20:29.250 --> 20:30.651
- We're firefighters! - Hello?

20:30.990 --> 20:32.520
- Say something if you hear us! - Hello?

20:32.820 --> 20:33.720
- Watch your steps. - Is anybody there?

20:33.790 --> 20:34.861
Hello?

20:35.020 --> 20:36.530
We're firefighters!

20:36.830 --> 20:38.030
Hello?

20:38.661 --> 20:40.060
We're firefighters!

20:41.560 --> 20:42.770
Hello?

20:43.000 --> 20:44.030
- Is anybody there? - Hello?

20:44.101 --> 20:44.770
Give me a hand.

20:45.300 --> 20:46.101
Watch your steps.

20:46.171 --> 20:47.000
Be careful.

20:47.171 --> 20:49.371
- Hello? - Is anyone there?

20:50.411 --> 20:51.171
Be quiet.

20:54.341 --> 20:55.181
Help!

21:00.280 --> 21:00.951
Save us!

21:01.080 --> 21:03.391
- Help! - We're here!

21:08.091 --> 21:09.060
Here!

21:10.461 --> 21:11.361
Over here!

21:11.490 --> 21:12.230
Over there!

21:12.830 --> 21:13.601
- Let's go. - Come on!

21:13.661 --> 21:14.560
Be careful. It's slippery.

21:14.631 --> 21:15.300
Watch your steps.

21:15.661 --> 21:16.431
Watch your steps.

21:16.500 --> 21:17.470
Watch your steps.

21:17.730 --> 21:18.800
How have you been?

21:19.401 --> 21:20.401
Still the same.

21:21.070 --> 21:22.401
Mom wants me to work in Guokun.

21:23.111 --> 21:24.211
What's your plan?

21:24.540 --> 21:25.341
I don't have one.

21:25.841 --> 21:26.911
I'll put it off as long as I can.

21:27.611 --> 21:28.740
That's because you're so smart.

21:29.111 --> 21:30.080
The investment company...

21:30.151 --> 21:31.411
is doing well.

21:32.280 --> 21:33.151
Are you mocking me?

21:34.220 --> 21:34.980
No.

21:36.220 --> 21:37.091
But to be honest,

21:37.990 --> 21:40.421
doing something you don't like so well...

21:41.220 --> 21:42.421
makes me quite admire you.

21:43.661 --> 21:44.490
If I were you,

21:45.260 --> 21:46.560
I might mess things up on purpose.

21:48.230 --> 21:51.171
I guess I'm obsessive-compulsive in some aspects.

21:51.800 --> 21:52.901
When I get a project,

21:53.101 --> 21:54.201
I always want it to be perfect.

21:54.701 --> 21:55.871
I don't want a bad result.

21:57.171 --> 21:58.540
I think you're too soft-hearted.

21:58.970 --> 21:59.780
You don't want...

21:59.841 --> 22:00.911
to disappoint our parents.

22:01.540 --> 22:02.381
You're not so bad yourself.

22:06.181 --> 22:06.881
Yan Chen.

22:08.550 --> 22:09.921
If you had a time machine,

22:10.891 --> 22:12.391
would you want to go back to the past...

22:12.591 --> 22:13.720
or to the future?

22:14.461 --> 22:16.490
Which stage of your life do you want to go to the most?

22:19.060 --> 22:19.961
I think I'll go back to the past.

22:20.730 --> 22:21.631
To the time...

22:22.060 --> 22:23.500
when you first came home.

22:27.671 --> 22:28.441
What about you?

22:32.841 --> 22:34.010
I'll go to the future.

22:34.740 --> 22:35.841
I want to see how we are...

22:35.911 --> 22:36.881
ten years from now.

22:38.750 --> 22:39.951
Be careful. It's okay.

22:40.621 --> 22:41.480
Hang in there.

22:41.550 --> 22:42.480
We'll get you out of here.

22:42.550 --> 22:43.990
Ouch. It hurts so much.

22:44.191 --> 22:44.891
It hurts.

22:45.490 --> 22:46.391
It really hurts.

22:53.461 --> 22:54.361
Reporting to headquarters.

22:54.431 --> 22:55.161
Reporting to headquarters.

22:55.461 --> 22:58.500
This is Shilitai Fire Station.

22:58.570 --> 23:02.040
All missing backpackers have been found.

23:02.101 --> 23:02.810
Over.

23:03.141 --> 23:04.111
Roger that.

23:04.310 --> 23:05.240
Reporting to Headquarters.

23:05.411 --> 23:07.240
This is firefighter Li Bin from Wufang Street Fire Station.

23:07.641 --> 23:10.451
The missing civilian rescue team has been found.

23:10.750 --> 23:11.780
We're heading down now.

23:12.451 --> 23:13.280
Copy that.

23:22.020 --> 23:22.730
Hello?

23:23.661 --> 23:24.961
Dr. Xu, this is Song Yan.

23:25.530 --> 23:26.230
Go ahead.

23:26.901 --> 23:28.060
Someone broke her leg.

23:28.131 --> 23:29.800
She said it can't be touched. It hurts upon contact.

23:30.330 --> 23:31.000
Here's the thing.

23:31.131 --> 23:32.500
The temperature is dropping,

23:32.570 --> 23:33.701
so we have to get her down the mountain.

23:33.770 --> 23:34.671
What should we do?

23:34.740 --> 23:35.871
Is it an open fracture...

23:35.941 --> 23:37.070
or a closed fracture?

23:37.470 --> 23:38.141
It's open.

23:38.211 --> 23:39.141
Do you have bandages and splints?

23:39.211 --> 23:39.941
Yes.

23:40.540 --> 23:41.540
Jun Ping, the medical bag.

23:41.740 --> 23:42.411
Here.

23:43.080 --> 23:44.780
Put pressure on the area and dress it first...

23:44.851 --> 23:45.611
to minimize bleeding.

23:45.750 --> 23:47.580
Afterwards, use a splint to secure it.

23:47.681 --> 23:48.820
Otherwise, you can't go down the mountain.

23:48.881 --> 23:50.651
Cushion the area where the splint...

23:50.720 --> 23:51.851
touches the body.

23:51.921 --> 23:52.921
Then secure the joints...

23:52.990 --> 23:54.591
above and below the fracture.

23:54.820 --> 23:56.020
Limit the movement of the fractured area.

23:56.091 --> 23:57.661
Fix the proximal end of the fracture first,

23:57.760 --> 23:58.760
then fix the distal end.

23:58.830 --> 24:00.000
Put her feet together,

24:00.060 --> 24:01.361
then add a thick pad in the middle.

24:01.830 --> 24:03.300
Secure it with a figure eight wrap.

24:03.371 --> 24:04.871
Make sure the tips of her toes are exposed.

24:05.330 --> 24:06.000
Always check the blood circulation...

24:06.070 --> 24:07.141
at the tip of the toes.

24:07.341 --> 24:09.671
If the tips of her toes feel numb or turn blue...

24:09.740 --> 24:10.911
or become cold,

24:11.040 --> 24:12.310
adjust them again.

24:13.240 --> 24:13.980
Got it.

24:14.240 --> 24:14.980
Thank you, Dr Xu.

24:15.411 --> 24:17.381
Be careful, Chief Song.

24:20.421 --> 24:21.921
- It's okay. Hang in there. - Don't touch me!

24:21.980 --> 24:22.820
- It hurts too much! - Endure it a bit.

24:23.020 --> 24:24.591
- It's all right. Don't worry. - Don't touch me.

24:28.820 --> 24:29.490
Hang in there.

24:29.560 --> 24:30.490
It's all right.

24:32.560 --> 24:33.300
It's okay now.

24:33.361 --> 24:34.030
Don't be scared.

24:34.631 --> 24:35.961
The temperature is dropping.

24:36.131 --> 24:36.931
We need to dress your wound...

24:37.000 --> 24:37.901
and get you down the mountain.

24:38.330 --> 24:39.401
If hypothermia sets in,

24:39.570 --> 24:40.441
everyone here...

24:40.500 --> 24:41.300
will be in danger.

24:44.040 --> 24:45.371
Here, cover yourselves.

24:46.341 --> 24:47.111
Keep warm.

24:47.611 --> 24:48.381
Be gentle.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.290
That was Song Yan, right?

24:59.451 --> 25:00.490
Is he that good?

25:01.961 --> 25:03.760
You haven't seen each other in ten years.

25:04.861 --> 25:05.861
Has it ever occurred to you...

25:06.230 --> 25:07.431
that people change?

25:08.300 --> 25:09.570
Time can change...

25:09.931 --> 25:11.901
those who aren't strong enough.

25:12.330 --> 25:13.201
Qin Qin.

25:13.270 --> 25:13.970
Yan Chen.

25:14.601 --> 25:15.800
I know you want to say...

25:15.871 --> 25:16.810
that it's impossible between us.

25:17.441 --> 25:18.111
Whether I like him...

25:18.171 --> 25:19.780
or if it's possible between us are two different things.

25:20.740 --> 25:21.941
It was my fault the other day.

25:22.580 --> 25:23.881
I shouldn't have said that.

25:24.810 --> 25:25.780
But has it ever occurred to you...

25:26.050 --> 25:26.851
that what I said...

25:26.951 --> 25:28.720
is the reality you have to face in the future?

25:29.520 --> 25:30.391
When the time comes,

25:30.451 --> 25:31.320
what are you going to do?

25:34.421 --> 25:35.691
I'm afraid of rifts...

25:36.691 --> 25:37.931
and conflicts.

25:38.330 --> 25:40.030
I'm also afraid of cleaning up messes.

25:41.760 --> 25:43.270
Leaving suits me a lot.

25:45.131 --> 25:47.300
But I don't want to be a deserter again.

25:47.570 --> 25:49.171
I'll look down on myself that way.

25:51.040 --> 25:51.810
I know,

25:51.941 --> 25:53.181
with my current capability,

25:54.381 --> 25:56.211
I still can't solve a lot of things.

25:57.050 --> 25:58.681
But I have to face...

25:59.080 --> 25:59.820
the consequences...

25:59.881 --> 26:01.050
that I have to bear.

26:15.330 --> 26:16.530
Be careful. It's slippery!

26:17.330 --> 26:18.371
The road is wet and slippery!

26:18.530 --> 26:19.800
Watch your steps!

26:23.111 --> 26:24.310
- Slowly. - Okay.

26:24.371 --> 26:25.070
Be careful.

26:25.141 --> 26:25.911
Here, give it to me.

26:34.451 --> 26:35.480
It hurts.

26:35.651 --> 26:36.320
Don't worry.

26:36.421 --> 26:37.391
- Hold on to the safety rope. - Be careful.

26:37.451 --> 26:38.391
You'll be fine.

26:41.921 --> 26:42.661
Hang in there.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.431
We're almost there.

26:44.691 --> 26:45.631
- Hang in there. - We're almost there.

26:45.691 --> 26:46.861
- Endure it a bit. - Hang in there.

26:46.931 --> 26:47.601
- Slowly. - We're almost...

26:47.661 --> 26:48.330
at the foot of the mountain.

26:49.970 --> 26:52.101
- Jun Ping! - Jun Ping!

26:52.171 --> 26:53.201
Slow down.

26:53.800 --> 26:55.901
- Jun Ping! - Jun Ping!

27:00.941 --> 27:02.010
Chief!

27:02.641 --> 27:03.750
Instructor!

27:04.010 --> 27:05.080
I'm fine!

27:08.151 --> 27:09.151
Jun Ping, are you okay?

27:09.220 --> 27:10.050
What's that situation?

27:10.790 --> 27:12.290
My foot is stuck!

27:12.621 --> 27:13.591
I can't get out!

27:13.790 --> 27:14.591
Safety rope.

27:15.191 --> 27:16.260
Safety rope!

27:16.760 --> 27:17.461
Here.

27:55.661 --> 27:56.770
Don't move. Let me see.

27:59.530 --> 28:01.171
Song Yan, how is it down there?

28:02.601 --> 28:03.371
Don't move.

28:06.641 --> 28:07.810
He can't move!

28:11.651 --> 28:13.621
Can you hurry up?

28:13.951 --> 28:15.480
It hurts so much!

28:16.391 --> 28:17.520
I can't take it anymore.

28:20.020 --> 28:21.720
Can you hurry up?

28:21.790 --> 28:23.091
It hurts so much.

28:24.290 --> 28:25.030
Look.

28:25.330 --> 28:26.461
It's so cold.

28:27.030 --> 28:28.300
There's an injured person here too.

28:28.500 --> 28:29.201
Can you...

28:29.330 --> 28:31.070
bring us and the injured down first?

28:36.411 --> 28:37.341
Jiang Yu!

28:38.211 --> 28:39.780
Bring them out first!

28:40.341 --> 28:41.611
Bring back a crowbar!

28:41.911 --> 28:42.740
Okay.

28:42.810 --> 28:43.550
No problem.

28:44.181 --> 28:45.951
Do you need anything else down there?

28:48.421 --> 28:49.480
Do you have water?

28:49.720 --> 28:50.421
Water.

28:50.490 --> 28:51.151
Who has water?

28:51.651 --> 28:52.320
Do you have water?

28:52.391 --> 28:53.060
We're out too.

28:53.121 --> 28:54.421
- We finished ours too. - No.

28:56.490 --> 28:57.730
Everyone is out of water!

28:57.830 --> 28:59.131
Let's split up.

28:59.230 --> 29:00.431
I'll bring them down...

29:00.530 --> 29:01.760
and bring your stuff up!

29:01.931 --> 29:02.830
Hang in there!

29:03.230 --> 29:03.901
Okay!

29:04.371 --> 29:05.330
Be careful!

29:26.191 --> 29:26.891
Can you handle it?

31:01.621 --> 31:03.050
(How is the situation now?)

31:08.820 --> 31:09.931
(Are you hurt?)

31:10.290 --> 31:11.461
(Are you back?)

31:30.250 --> 31:32.351
(Hello, the subscriber you are calling...)

31:32.411 --> 31:33.951
(is currently unavailable.)

31:34.421 --> 31:35.681
(Please try again later.)

32:00.211 --> 32:00.911
I wonder what's going on.

32:00.980 --> 32:02.411
- Have they saved them or not? - That's right.

32:02.480 --> 32:04.250
What's taking the firefighters so long?

32:04.381 --> 32:05.750
Don't panic first, everyone.

32:05.851 --> 32:07.151
The firefighters already went in.

32:07.220 --> 32:08.480
We'll hear from them soon.

32:08.550 --> 32:09.381
Don't panic, everyone.

32:09.451 --> 32:10.520
- Don't panic. - How can we not panic?

32:10.591 --> 32:12.451
- Eat something warm first. - It's been a day.

32:12.520 --> 32:13.990
- Have some water. - I don't want it.

32:14.060 --> 32:14.861
It's cold at night.

32:14.921 --> 32:15.790
Bring a box back later.

32:15.861 --> 32:16.760
Okay.

32:19.260 --> 32:20.431
Have some water.

32:25.500 --> 32:26.470
I think someone's coming.

32:26.530 --> 32:27.701
- It's them. - There's a light.

32:28.401 --> 32:29.371
It's them.

32:29.540 --> 32:30.611
They're back!

32:32.040 --> 32:33.310
Hurry up!

32:33.381 --> 32:34.780
They're out. Hurry!

32:34.841 --> 32:35.510
Hurry up!

32:35.580 --> 32:36.341
Watch your steps.

32:42.621 --> 32:43.320
Don't panic.

32:43.391 --> 32:44.421
Make way!

32:44.520 --> 32:45.220
Excuse me.

32:45.290 --> 32:46.391
Make way. Sorry.

32:46.591 --> 32:47.421
Excuse me.

32:50.230 --> 32:51.891
Hurry, take her to the hospital.

32:52.931 --> 32:54.161
- Slowly. - Make way.

32:56.970 --> 32:57.671
Dad.

32:58.131 --> 32:59.631
Dad, I was so scared.

32:59.701 --> 33:01.540
Wait. Instructor...

33:03.740 --> 33:04.711
It's good that you're okay.

33:09.510 --> 33:10.451
Where's Song Yan?

33:10.651 --> 33:12.080
One of our team members got stuck in a rock.

33:12.151 --> 33:13.211
He's on the mountain with him.

33:13.351 --> 33:14.050
What are we waiting for?

33:14.121 --> 33:15.280
Xiaobin, where's the crowbar?

33:15.351 --> 33:16.891
You two, come with me to get them.

33:17.320 --> 33:19.020
Pi Pi, Ge Zheng, Da Peng, Jiang Yi!

33:19.391 --> 33:20.220
- Present! - Present!

33:20.320 --> 33:22.091
Go up the mountain and get Chief Song back.

33:42.540 --> 33:44.151
- Chief! - Chief!

33:44.211 --> 33:45.250
Jun Ping!

33:48.851 --> 33:49.750
Chief!

33:55.591 --> 33:56.661
Jun Ping!

33:57.631 --> 34:00.201
- Chief! - Chief!

34:00.260 --> 34:01.101
Jun Ping!

34:01.431 --> 34:02.401
Jun Ping!

34:03.570 --> 34:04.830
- Chief! - Chief!

34:04.901 --> 34:05.601
Chief!

34:06.601 --> 34:07.401
Chief!

34:08.101 --> 34:08.901
Chief!

34:10.711 --> 34:12.911
- Chief! - Chief!

34:12.970 --> 34:13.941
Jun Ping!

34:32.491 --> 34:33.560
Ambulance, hurry!

34:33.631 --> 34:34.560
Take him to the hospital!

34:41.870 --> 34:42.770
Jiang Yi.

34:43.270 --> 34:43.941
Here.

34:45.211 --> 34:45.971
Cover yourself.

34:50.281 --> 34:52.151
Here, have some water.

34:52.980 --> 34:53.651
Jiang Yi.

34:53.721 --> 34:54.381
Jiang Yi.

34:54.450 --> 34:55.250
Wait.

34:56.080 --> 34:56.790
Have some.

35:03.631 --> 35:04.330
Have some food.

35:06.131 --> 35:06.961
I'm fine.

35:07.700 --> 35:08.560
Leave the food...

35:09.230 --> 35:11.000
to the backpackers and their families.

35:11.200 --> 35:12.531
The backpackers and their families?

35:12.600 --> 35:13.941
They're long gone.

35:16.810 --> 35:17.640
They just left?

35:20.040 --> 35:21.781
They said they were taking them to the hospital,

35:21.841 --> 35:22.941
but they're really afraid that they'll get punished...

35:23.011 --> 35:24.680
if the reporters expose them.

35:29.020 --> 35:30.591
Who would punish them?

36:07.261 --> 36:08.261
You're still up?

36:08.721 --> 36:09.560
Aren't you tired?

36:11.930 --> 36:12.890
I'm fine.

36:14.330 --> 36:15.560
Does this kind of thing...

36:17.100 --> 36:18.531
happen a lot?

36:20.000 --> 36:21.571
Based on the probability,

36:21.971 --> 36:23.370
it's decreasing year by year.

36:24.441 --> 36:26.171
Because the environment is getting better.

36:28.810 --> 36:31.410
It's really hard to encounter something like this.

36:33.651 --> 36:34.680
You already can't handle...

36:35.450 --> 36:36.520
something so trivial?

36:37.520 --> 36:39.520
The situation is nothing.

36:40.191 --> 36:41.390
But mental hardship...

36:43.191 --> 36:44.131
is the hard part.

36:46.730 --> 36:48.031
I told you.

36:48.500 --> 36:49.700
You're too idealistic.

36:51.270 --> 36:53.000
You've been sheltered for too long.

36:55.301 --> 36:56.600
You're attacking me again.

36:57.341 --> 36:58.040
No.

37:01.841 --> 37:03.040
You did well today.

37:06.151 --> 37:08.080
Since we're on the subject, tell me the truth.

37:09.080 --> 37:11.520
Do you really think I'm very idealistic?

37:12.290 --> 37:13.890
Do you think...

37:15.020 --> 37:17.060
I chose this profession...

37:17.461 --> 37:19.160
for some kind of glory...

37:19.691 --> 37:21.230
or for a short-lived passion?

37:22.131 --> 37:23.531
Once the passion is gone,

37:24.370 --> 37:25.870
the glory will disappear,

37:27.270 --> 37:28.770
and my ideals will be crushed.

37:32.171 --> 37:33.881
You thought about it well.

37:36.810 --> 37:38.250
I'll be honest with you.

37:40.980 --> 37:43.051
Actually, I gave careful thought about this decision.

37:43.450 --> 37:44.421
Like you said,

37:44.850 --> 37:46.450
I do have many choices.

37:47.591 --> 37:50.230
But it doesn't mean mine...

37:51.961 --> 37:53.930
isn't as serious as yours.

37:55.301 --> 37:57.200
I'm not thinking about glory...

37:57.270 --> 37:59.071
or being a hero.

38:01.401 --> 38:03.441
I just like doing this.

38:05.241 --> 38:07.040
I want to do something for this profession.

38:07.511 --> 38:08.511
I even...

38:10.580 --> 38:12.080
want to do better every day.

38:15.980 --> 38:16.850
You know what?

38:17.651 --> 38:19.020
Every time I take a shower,

38:19.421 --> 38:22.060
when the water keeps falling on my head,

38:23.491 --> 38:24.890
I'd think of three things.

38:28.230 --> 38:30.131
I hope I can fit in with everyone soon.

38:31.971 --> 38:33.770
I hope I can become better.

38:35.500 --> 38:36.801
I hope I can do more...

38:39.140 --> 38:40.511
for this fire station.

38:50.790 --> 38:52.390
I already said a lot. Why did you stop talking?

38:52.890 --> 38:53.821
Say something.

38:56.020 --> 38:57.361
Some of our views...

38:58.730 --> 38:59.761
are the same.

39:05.600 --> 39:07.171
I'll take that as a compliment.

39:31.961 --> 39:38.301
(How is the situation now? Are you hurt? Are you back?)

39:46.810 --> 39:51.350
(Don't worry, I'm back.)

40:34.421 --> 40:35.821
The stuff has been here for a while.

40:35.890 --> 40:37.060
What took you so long?

40:37.361 --> 40:39.491
- We got stuck in traffic. - Let's move the stuff first.

40:42.060 --> 40:43.160
Here, this is for you.

40:43.230 --> 40:44.270
- All right. - Give it to me.

40:44.500 --> 40:45.500
The flowers are so pretty.

40:47.870 --> 40:48.540
Thank you.

40:48.600 --> 40:50.200
- Let's go. - Thank you, sir.

40:52.571 --> 40:53.441
Hello.

40:53.540 --> 40:55.711
- Hello. - We're here to visit Liu Jun Ping.

40:56.341 --> 40:58.051
Okay, just a moment.

41:11.361 --> 41:12.761
We're here to visit you.

41:12.830 --> 41:13.560
Jun Ping.

41:13.631 --> 41:14.361
Hello, Class Monitor.

41:15.160 --> 41:16.361
- Class Monitor. - You're all here?

41:16.961 --> 41:17.700
Hello, Class Monitor.

41:18.270 --> 41:19.270
You shouldn't have spent so much money.

41:19.330 --> 41:20.971
Spent so much money? What are you thinking?

41:21.200 --> 41:23.171
These are from friendly people.

41:23.741 --> 41:25.171
Jun Ping, get well soon.

41:25.241 --> 41:26.471
Many girls outside...

41:26.540 --> 41:27.381
were waiting to see you.

41:28.381 --> 41:29.040
Seriously?

41:29.111 --> 41:29.941
Yes.

41:31.281 --> 41:32.781
Should I freshen up then?

41:34.151 --> 41:35.250
There's no need.

41:35.781 --> 41:36.520
Chief said...

41:36.580 --> 41:38.921
your priority now is to rest.

41:39.020 --> 41:39.950
Too many visitors...

41:40.020 --> 41:40.890
would delay your recovery.

41:41.191 --> 41:42.191
- Right. - So we already sent them away.

41:42.491 --> 41:43.261
They're gone?

41:45.031 --> 41:46.031
They're gone.

41:46.091 --> 41:47.430
But they left fruits and flowers for you.

41:47.500 --> 41:48.430
Here, Class Monitor.

41:50.671 --> 41:51.770
Are we leaving the fruits?

41:52.000 --> 41:53.071
Are you sure?

41:53.131 --> 41:54.401
Eating too much will cause heatiness.

41:54.700 --> 41:56.370
No, I don't want the fruits.

41:56.441 --> 41:57.341
Take them.

41:58.841 --> 41:59.741
You're really taking them?

41:59.810 --> 42:00.711
Yes.

42:00.941 --> 42:01.611
No, then...

42:02.111 --> 42:03.410
Then leave some that doesn't cause heatiness.

42:03.480 --> 42:05.011
- What doesn't cause heatiness? - Which one?

42:06.151 --> 42:06.950
Class Monitor, apple.

42:07.011 --> 42:08.281
Apples don't cause heatiness.

42:08.480 --> 42:09.680
Oranges make your desires come true.

42:09.750 --> 42:10.651
Orange doesn't cause heatiness.

42:10.721 --> 42:11.421
Class Monitor.

42:11.491 --> 42:12.421
The rest causes heatiness.

42:12.491 --> 42:14.060
Indeed. Lychees cause too much heatiness.

42:14.120 --> 42:14.821
You...

42:14.890 --> 42:15.560
Go.

42:16.060 --> 42:17.730
- Thank you, Class Monitor. - Thank you, Class Monitor.

42:18.160 --> 42:19.261
The flowers are pretty.

42:19.531 --> 42:20.730
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

42:21.531 --> 42:22.560
Thank you.

42:27.000 --> 42:28.500
- Don't eat too much at a time. - Eat slowly.

42:34.910 --> 42:35.781
The girls are gone.

42:38.680 --> 42:39.980
The fruits are gone too.
